  partName: Gasket (2)
  description: The Gasket (2) is a thin, flat component positioned at the top-center-front
    of the engine, serving as a seal between two critical engine components. Constructed
    from Material.002, this tiny part is essential for preventing fluid leaks and
    maintaining engine efficiency, and its flat shape allows for a secure, even seal.
    Notably, the gasket's material properties enable it to withstand extreme temperatures
    and pressures.
